This extension ports the DiffusionGemma and Gemma 4 code of Bubo
(https://github.com/haloforge-labs/bubo, Halowin Bubo by HaloForge Labs),
a fork of Gufo, under the MIT License ("Copyright (c) 2026 gufo
contributors"). Ported files keep their structure; changes adapt them to the
public Gufo extension API.

Model weights are not part of this repository. DiffusionGemma weights carry
their own license (see the model card of the checkpoint you use).
